# Boost on 34's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# Bibarel carries Strength from here on (Take Down out; Mt Coronet 1F North Room 1's boulder, 35); every member
# levelled (HP refilled), the lead's four moves set again (PP refilled), for the Route 216/217 trainers.
party-level 0 66
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-move 0 3 MOVE_ROCK_SLIDE
party-level 1 30
party-level 2 45
party-move 2 3 MOVE_STRENGTH
party-level 3 50
